  "abstract": "Baseline Fourier forecaster with LayerNorm across factors, amplitudes from scalar per-factor context (mean over 4 steps), gamma[t] initialized to 0.5 (zeros logits), residual copy head, gradient clipping=1.0, Adam lr=1e-3. Goal: recover the strong LN baseline (p\u224836) before adding capacity.",
